<title>NETHERLANDS: ING NO COMMENT ON WINTERTHUR TALK.</title>
<headline>ING NO COMMENT ON WINTERTHUR TALK.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch financial services group Internationale Nederlanden Groep NV (ING) said on Thursday it had no comment on talk that it was interested in buying Winterthur Insurance Co of Switzerland.</p>
<p>Brokers said rumours that ING was interested in the Swiss insurer contributed to strength in the Dutch group's share price, which closed up 0.70 at 54.70 guilders.</p>
<p>An ING spokesman told Reuters she had heard the rumours were circulating in financial markets.</p>
<p>But she added: &quot;We never comment on rumours.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
